

<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>

  <meta charset="UTF-8">

  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Eri Ayo Enterprise | Food & Groceries</title>

  <style>

    * {

      margin: 0;

      padding: 0;

      box-sizing: border-box;

      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;

    }

    body {

      background: #f4f8ff;

      color: #183153;

    }

    header {

      background: #0756a5;

      color: white;

      padding: 22px 7%;

      display: flex;

      justify-content: space-between;

      align-items: center;

      flex-wrap: wrap;

      gap: 15px;

    }

    header h2 {

      font-size: 23px;

    }

    nav a {

      color: white;

      text-decoration: none;

      margin-left: 15px;

      font-weight: bold;

    }

    .hero {

      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #0756a5, #328de0);

      color: white;

      text-align: center;

      padding: 100px 20px;

    }

    .hero h1 {

      font-size: 42px;

      margin-bottom: 20px;

    }

    .hero p {

      font-size: 18px;

      margin-bottom: 30px;

    }

    .btn {

      display: inline-block;

      background: white;

      color: #0756a5;

      padding: 15px 30px;

      text-decoration: none;

      border-radius: 7px;

      font-weight: bold;

    }

    section {

      padding: 65px 7%;

      text-align: center;

    }

    section h2 {

      color: #0756a5;

      font-size: 30px;

      margin-bottom: 20px;

    }

    .products {

      display: grid;

      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));

      gap: 25px;

      margin-top: 35px;

    }

    .product {

      background: white;

      padding: 35px 20px;

      border-radius: 12px;

      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px #00000012;

    }

    .product span {

      font-size: 45px;

    }

    .product h3 {

      color: #0756a5;

      margin: 15px 0;

    }

    #contact {

      background: #e5f1ff;

    }

    footer {

      background: #073b70;

      color: white;

      text-align: center;

      padding: 25px;

    }

    @media(max-width: 600px) {

      header {

        justify-content: center;

        text-align: center;

      }

      nav a {

        margin: 5px;

        display: inline-block;

      }

      .hero h1 {

        font-size: 32px;

      }

    }

  </style>

</head>

<body>

  <header>

    <h2>ERI AYO ENTERPRISE</h2>

    <nav>

      <a href="#home">Home</a>

      <a href="#about">About</a>

      <a href="#products">Products</a>

      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>

    </nav>

  </header>

  <div class="hero" id="home">

    <h1>Welcome to Eri Ayo Enterprise</h1>

    <p>Your trusted destination for quality food and groceries.</p>

    <a href="#products" class="btn">Explore Our Products</a>

  </div>

  <section id="about">

    <h2>About Us</h2>

    <p>

      Eri Ayo Enterprise is committed to providing

      quality food and grocery products to our customers.

      Our goal is to deliver quality products and excellent

      customer service.

    </p>

  </section>

  <section id="products">

    <h2>Our Products</h2>

    <p>Discover our range of food and grocery products.</p>

    <div class="products">

      <div class="product">

        <span>🍚</span>

        <h3>Rice & Grains</h3>

        <p>Quality rice and grains for your home.</p>

      </div>

      <div class="product">

        <span>🥬</span>

        <h3>Vegetables</h3>

        <p>Fresh vegetables for healthy meals.</p>

      </div>

      <div class="product">

        <span>🍎</span>

        <h3>Fresh Fruits</h3>

        <p>Delicious fruits for everyone.</p>

      </div>

      <div class="product">

        <span>🛒</span>

        <h3>Groceries</h3>

        <p>Everyday household food essentials.</p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>

  <section id="contact">

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>

    <p>We look forward to serving you!</p>

    <p>Get in touch with us for enquiries and orders.</p>

  </section>

  <footer>

    <p>© 2026 Eri Ayo Enterprise. All Rights Reserved.</p>

  </footer>

</body>

</html>
